<title>HONG KONG: Guoco Land year net down 55 percent.</title>
<headline>Guoco Land year net down 55 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   73.0	 vs 188.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  19.19 gain vs 8.39 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    47.64	vs 105.89</p>
<p>    Turnover		     43.61	vs 599.49</p>
<p>    Company name		 Guoco Land Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 26 to July 4</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Guoco Land was formerly Lap Heng Co Ltd, is a watch manufacturer and distributor.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$21.22 million on disposal of long term listed investments and loss of HK$2.03 million on special legal and professional fee for the relisting of the company's shares on The Stock Exchange of Hong Kong Ltd.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs 80 cents (including interim dividend and cash bonus).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
